WEBVTT

00:00:03.057 --> 00:00:03.706
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:07.123
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can you <b>play</b> a <b>musical instrument</b>?

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:08.419
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes,</b> I <b>can</b>.

00:00:09.113 --> 00:00:10.332
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What</b> can you <b>play</b>?

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:11.960
<v><b>B:</b></v> I can <b>play</b> the <b>guitar</b>.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.412
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:16.964
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Where</b> can I <b>sit</b>?

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.383
<v><b>B:</b></v> You can <b>sit over there</b>.

00:00:21.045 --> 00:00:21.700
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:23.112 --> 00:00:24.261
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can I <b>park here</b>?

00:00:25.074 --> 00:00:27.628
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No,</b> you <b>can’t</b>. You <b>can’t park here</b>.